## Commands
| Task | Command |
|---|---|
| Format | `make fmt` |
| Lint | `make lint` |
| Unit tests | `make test` |
| Integration tests | `make test-integration` (needs Docker) |
| Run locally | `make run` (uses launchpad-infra compose.dev.yml for dependencies) |

## Non-negotiables
- Follow the service spec and conventions; report contradictions as `spec-bug` issues in launchpad-meta.
- Never log or emit secrets/env values/tokens. Parameterized SQL only.
- Events: envelope + schema-valid `data`; DB-backed events via the outbox.
- Don't edit `.github/`, `.claude/`, `CODEOWNERS`, `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md` (agent-config).
- Tests for every acceptance criterion; never weaken tests to pass.
- PR body: acceptance matrix with real command outcomes.
- These repo instructions take precedence over plugin skills. In CI (headless), never use skills that wait for a human (superpowers `brainstorming`, `finishing-a-development-branch`, `executing-plans` checkpoints).
